在機艙工作的日子，但現在不只是服務，更是透過一碗拉麵，帶給客人一段記憶。\n離開前我對他們說：「Gracias！」他們笑著回：「下次來台灣一定會再回來！」\n來自西班牙的他們，與台灣的我們，因為一碗拉麵而相遇。\n\nToday, a backpacking couple walked in and playfully asked, “Are you sure it’s good?”\nI smiled and said, “Of course.”\nThey ordered our Akaoni Seafood Tonkotsu Ramen, Black Garlic Duck Breast Ramen, and Karaage Chicken Salad.\nThe smiles on their faces after finishing said everything — pure satisfaction.\nWhen I invited them to leave a review, they immediately scanned the QR code and even asked to take a photo together.\nMoments like this remind me of my days as cabin crew. But now, it’s more than service — it’s about creating memories through a bowl of ramen.\nBefore leaving, I said “Gracias!”\nThey replied, “We’ll definitely come back next time we visit Taiwan!”\nTwo places, far apart in the world, connected by a simple bowl of ramen.\nMoments like this truly make it all worthwhile.",1]]],[1777274552,1793085752],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipORTDHW4Hei3jJZ_fecal55h68oLNoFLcot_-gW\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipORTDHW4Hei3jJZ_fecal55h68oLNoFLcot_-gW"]],"6146081256686643537","8270955745292171165",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dd777865217e22ae8\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F8270955745292171165%2FlocalPosts%2F6146081256686643537/version/1777274551885000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCNHS-YvvitGlVRIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTEwyc2E2dG44ekM0Z0UaEkNnc0l1SjI4endZUTBKZmFiQQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5UgGicOFkL7AeK3xB7YpziE","0ahUKEwjXoqn2wNKWAxXwdfUHHcTOKXYQ544CCKMCKDM",null,"2026年4月27日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u8270955745292171165/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM2MTQ2MDgxMjU2Njg2NjQzNTM3","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u8270955745292171165/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM2MTQ2MDgxMjU2Njg2NjQzNTM3",null,null,null,null,null,["6146081256686643537","CIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE","CgsIuJ28zwYQ0JfabA"]],[null,[[["平常日的迪化街，人潮會慢慢退去，街道變得安靜許多。但有時候，店裡卻會出現一種讓人特別開心的畫面——一群高中生進來，接著又一群，再接著又一群（我一度以為是不是校外教學改來吃拉麵了😂）。\n\n看著他們邊聊天邊吃麵，有人專心到完全不講話，有人第一口就眼睛亮起來，還有人默默把湯喝到見底。離開前丟下一句：「老闆，真的很好吃欸！」那一瞬間，比營業額還讓人滿足。\n\n也許對他們來說，只是一碗平凡的拉麵。但對我來說，那是一段會被記住的青春片段。\n\n所以我們在想——是不是該為這些用笑容支持我們的學生們，做點什麼。\n\n📣 近期正在規劃「學生限定優惠」讓你們在課業與未來的壓力之間，至少可以有一碗熱騰騰的拉麵，稍微喘口氣。\n\n（放心，份量不會變少，青春需要補充熱量😆）\n\n敬請期待。也歡迎繼續帶著同學一起來，把店裡變成最吵最熱鬧的地方。",1]]],[1777024679,1792835879],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipPhzRNiD6oaMeCLOzTwD_jJbDjPVznvenYyv6ya\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipPhzRNiD6oaMeCLOzTwD_jJbDjPVznvenYyv6ya"]],"2480286305117840426","8270955745292171165",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dd777865217e22ae8\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEObi-JPJuqzaZw\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEObi-JPJuqzaZw,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F8270955745292171165%2FlocalPosts%2F2480286305117840426/version/1777024678953000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCKrIwu6N6O-1IhIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFT2JpLUpQSnVxemFadxoTQ2d3SXBfMnN6d1lRNk15bmtnRQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%8