VlVwWVZsUlplR016WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLU0ZKdVRsTlViSEJ2VmpGamVGUkZOVk5WVlVwWVZsUlplR016WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLU0ZKdVRsTlViSEJ2VmpGamVGUkZOVk5WVlVwWVZsUlplR016WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhLU0ZKdVRsTlViSEJ2VmpGamVGUkZOVk5WVlVwWVZsUlplR016WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你這麼用心寫下完整的用餐體驗，也很感謝你的肯定與建議！\n很開心你喜歡我們的濃厚厚切豚骨拉麵，特別是湯頭的濃郁感、洋蔥的平衡，以及厚切叉燒的口感，這些都是我們在 台北迪化街赤羽拉麵很重視的核心風味設計。也很高興叉燒飯有讓你覺得香氣和肉量都滿足。\n關於你提到的服務細節與籃子詢問方式，我們會再提醒現場流程，讓服務在忙碌時也能更細緻。叉燒飯未附湯匙的部分也謝謝你指出，我們會立即檢視備餐與提供方式，避免影響用餐體驗。\n至於赤鬼鴨拉麵，你的觀察很準確，它本身就是偏向日式風味設計，搭配叉燒與鴨肉的組合，希望呈現不同層次的選擇。\n謝謝你這麼細緻的回饋，對我們改善非常有幫助，也期待你下次再來迪化街時，能有更完整的體驗。",null,[0,123]]]],[null,null,11977,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKSFJuTlNUbHBvVjFjeFRFNVNVVUpYVlRZeGMzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5e3dae69e6c8d0af!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlJHRnNSTlpoV1cxTE5SUUJXVTYxc3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKSFJuTlNUbHBvVjFjeFRFNVNVVUpYVlRZeGMzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKSFJuTlNUbHBvVjFjeFRFNVNVVUpYVlRZeGMzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKSFJuTlNUbHBvVjFjeFRFNVNVVUpYVlRZeGMzYxILMGRldzBQbFFya2oaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sSkhSbk5TVGxwb1YxY3hURTVTVVVKWFZUWXhjM2MSCzBkZXcwUGxRcmtqIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARr9DI5mmuPV4qCzBkZXcwUGxRcmtq\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjXoqn2wNKWAxXwdfUHHcTOKXYQoykIgQEoDg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiX9a72wNKWAxVseF4EHQunE2MQ0pMFCCEoAg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjXoqn2wNKWAxXwdfUHHcTOKXYQ0pMFCGkoAg"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOT05qTnVMV2swUWxsalFqTm5lVFpxVEhSMFRWRRAB",["0x0:0x5e3dae69e6c8d0af",null,1765084774698315,17